# 19. HEALTH INFORMATION AND COMPLIANCE

This business handles herbal, Ayurvedic, traditional pansari, food-related and religious-use ingredients.

Different products may fall under different regulatory categories.

Implement a proper classification and review system.

Before publishing medical, nutritional or product-performance claims, verify the applicable Indian regulations, product classification, licensing requirements and advertising restrictions using current official sources.

Do not assume that one licence covers all products.

Do not publish claims such as:

- Guaranteed cure.
- Permanent disease treatment.
- 100% safe.
- No side effects.
- Guaranteed diabetes control.
- Guaranteed cancer treatment.
- Guaranteed weight loss.
- Clinically proven without evidence.
- Government approved without documentation.
- Certified organic without verification.

Use cautious, accurate and evidence-supported language.

